g/noFilter"},"playing":6,"visitor":74366908,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2023-10-06T13:19:07.101Z","creator":{"name":"pug x axel","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":12805830692,"name":"IQ Obby","desc":"Do you have HIGH IQ?!?!!?\n\nTest your IQ AND SKILLS HERE AND OBTAIN SPECIAL GEARS FOR EACH OBBY YOU COMPLETE.\nthis game requires knowledge of roblox's popular glitches, \n\nBoth R6 and R15 are available depending on your avatar.\n\nIf you have earned a new badge, rejoin for it's item.\nAll your items will be in your backpack including game passes.\n\nThe higher the IQ, the higher the quality and appeal of the item.\nLow Quality Game (1,1)\n\n(Huge Update & Giveaway Coming Soon)","path":"/game/12805830692-iq-obby","slug":"12805830692-iq-obby","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/db102c021754fa48abb918f59b9a646eb0a06eacc96666885f41d79b78f1e784.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f785db1169e48e74c7d108d84883805f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":6,"visitor":23030883,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-27T11:32:49.096Z","creator":{"name":"Ncraft Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":14028946967,"name":"📉 Cart ride to save canny cat [PONZI SCHEMES!]","desc":"a remake for crtscc is in the works, stay tuned\n\nCore mechanics inspired by \"Cart ride around a 75kw diesel generator\". it should be in similar experiences go check it out too\n\nThe evil 🐈‍⬛ uncanny cats have kidnapped 🐈 canny cat and put him at the end of a perilous cart ride. Grab a cart and go save your kitty!\n\nControls/Tips:\n\nCTRL to shiftlock\nLMB or DOUBLE TAP to pick up unanchored part (such as a cart)\nSHIFT + WASDQE or ROTATE BUTTON + JOYSTICK to rotate currently held part\n\nTo start the game, pick up a cart and place it on the rails, then click the green button to start the cart. Make sure to look out for traps along the way! \nRemember that if your cart derails, you can jump out and drag it back into place. \n\nBuilding and electrical signals in this game can be confusing at first. Just remember that only parts which are glued together will transfer signals, and don't be afraid to ask experienced players for help. \n\nHave fun! 💥💥💥","path":"/game/14028946967-cart-ride-to-save-canny-cat","slug":"14028946967-cart-ride-to-save-canny-cat","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/731d06c28a16051d8aa224abd7738767121bc30c75a993c20c788fe41eb033b9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ab9a30c5928bcf53b5e9033807f78701/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":6,"visitor":1663127,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-22T04:04:25.637Z","creator":{"name":"Acetaldehyde (2, 4-dinitrophenyl) hydrazone Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":11421782440,"name":"(Up-to-date) [399] Find the Toasties","desc":"Welcome to Find the Toasties, i guess. just uh go in and find and collect all the toasties and guess what? the best part about it is that you get a badge!!1! pretty cool ngl. yeah pretty much. Please note that while the game IS available on all Devices, some such as Console will have some collectables locked away due to roblox restrictions.\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n- Update 20.13 -\n- Updated every accessible realm to have the most recent systems\n- Updated the donation board from 9000 to 10000\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCredits to DM DO KU RO for some songs used.","path":"/game/11421782440-find-the-toasties","slug":"11421782440-find-the-toasties","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/029a39faf86cb98c090728323e1cd92bba5ba0b471ad192fd915a9a815d1b7cc.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e6672479f4bb32a6da38f5c9f9247144/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":6,"visitor":19895270,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-29T